<h1 id="user-content-the-reality-of-anger"><a class="anchor" href="#the-reality-of-anger" aria-hidden="true"></a>The Reality of Anger</h1>
<p>It is easy to get angry, at some point it is almost enjoyable, I thought that by getting angry I have the power to enact change, take for example road rage, you feel that these people better not mess with me because I am angry, how foolish are we to think that we have any impact on anything</p>
<p>No one cares, you are just a raging lunatic in the corner irrelevant to everything, you have no control over anything, we enjoy it because we think we have control we don't</p>
<p>Stay in your lane, shut up and stay calm</p>
<p>We aren't in control</p>
</Blog>
